OL,3,GNEWSAPC denies causing death of boy,
OL,4,A16, in e-bike crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA serving police officer has denied
OL,7,Fcausing the death of a 16-year-old boy
OL,8,Fin a crash involving an electric bike
OL,9,Fand two cars.
OL,11,FEmergency services were called to
OL,12,FChilwell Lane, Bramcote, on 28
OL,13,FSeptember 2025 following reports of the
OL,14,Fcrash. The electric bike rider, Ryley
OL,15,FHutson, was pronounced dead at the
OL,16,Fscene.
OL,18,FDaniel Cartwright, who is a police
OL,19,Fconstable at Bedfordshire Police and
OL,20,Fwas off-duty at the time, was later
OL,21,Fcharged with causing death by dangerous
OL,22,Fdriving.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
