OL,3,GNEWSAPC denies causing death of boy,
OL,4,A16, in e-bike crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 31-year-old, from Kettering in
OL,7,FNorthamptonshire, entered a not guilty
OL,8,Fplea at Nottingham Crown Court on
OL,9,FFriday, and a trial date was set for 11
OL,10,FJanuary.
